{
 "titulo": "What Would YOUR Life Be Like in The Backrooms?",
 "cenas": [
  {
   "id": "001",
   "texto": "You just fell out of reality, into the Backrooms, and the first thing that can kill you here isn't a monster.",
   "capitulo": "0",
   "nome_capitulo": "Abertura",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": true,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": true
  },
  {
   "id": "002",
   "texto": "It's thirst.",
   "capitulo": "0",
   "nome_capitulo": "Abertura",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "003",
   "texto": "No map. No exit sign. Just damp carpet, yellow walls, and a hum that never stops.",
   "capitulo": "0",
   "nome_capitulo": "Abertura",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "004",
   "texto": "So I'm going to tell you how this goes, from your first step to your last.",
   "capitulo": "0",
   "nome_capitulo": "Abertura",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "005",
   "texto": "Because I'll be honest with you from the start.",
   "capitulo": "0",
   "nome_capitulo": "Abertura",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "006",
   "texto": "You don't make it out.",
   "capitulo": "0",
   "nome_capitulo": "Abertura",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "007",
   "texto": "The only questions are how long you last, and what finally gets you.",
   "capitulo": "0",
   "nome_capitulo": "Abertura",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "008",
   "texto": "And the strangest part is that this place started with a real photo.",
   "capitulo": "0",
   "nome_capitulo": "Abertura",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "009",
   "texto": "It was taken in 2002, inside a store being renovated in Oshkosh, Wisconsin.",
   "capitulo": "0",
   "nome_capitulo": "Abertura",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": true,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "010",
   "texto": "In 2019, someone posted it on 4chan with a short story about \"six hundred million square miles of randomly segmented empty rooms.\"",
   "capitulo": "0",
   "nome_capitulo": "Abertura",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": true,
   "extra": true
  },
  {
   "id": "011",
   "texto": "Nobody knew where the photo came from until May 2024.",
   "capitulo": "0",
   "nome_capitulo": "Abertura",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": true,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "012",
   "texto": "Since then, writers on the Backrooms Wiki have mapped that place, level by level.",
   "capitulo": "0",
   "nome_capitulo": "Abertura",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "013",
   "texto": "That wiki is our map today. Every rule in this story comes from it.",
   "capitulo": "0",
   "nome_capitulo": "Abertura",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "014",
   "texto": "Let's start with the hour you arrive.",
   "capitulo": "0",
   "nome_capitulo": "Abertura",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "015",
   "texto": "It happens the way it often happens: by accident.",
   "capitulo": "1",
   "nome_capitulo": "Hour 1",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": true,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "016",
   "texto": "You trip in a dark hallway at home, and instead of hitting the floor, you go through it.",
   "capitulo": "1",
   "nome_capitulo": "Hour 1",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": true
  },
  {
   "id": "017",
   "texto": "Level 0. The wiki calls it Threshold. Most people know it as the Lobby.",
   "capitulo": "1",
   "nome_capitulo": "Hour 1",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "018",
   "texto": "Yellow wallpaper. Fluorescent lights. And carpet that is always wet.",
   "capitulo": "1",
   "nome_capitulo": "Hour 1",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "019",
   "texto": "The smell is the first thing that tells you something is wrong. Old, soaked carpet.",
   "capitulo": "1",
   "nome_capitulo": "Hour 1",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "020",
   "texto": "The second thing is the sound.",
   "capitulo": "1",
   "nome_capitulo": "Hour 1",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "021",
   "texto": "The lights hum, and the hum rises and falls, but it never stops.",
   "capitulo": "1",
   "nome_capitulo": "Hour 1",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "022",
   "texto": "That part is real, by the way.",
   "capitulo": "1",
   "nome_capitulo": "Hour 1",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "023",
   "texto": "Old fluorescent lights flicker about a hundred times a second, too fast for you to see.",
   "capitulo": "1",
   "nome_capitulo": "Hour 1",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": true,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "024",
   "texto": "In a 1989 study in British offices, switching to lights that didn't flicker cut headaches and eyestrain by more than half.",
   "capitulo": "1",
   "nome_capitulo": "Hour 1",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": true,
   "extra": true
  },
  {
   "id": "025",
   "texto": "So within an hour, your head hurts.",
   "capitulo": "1",
   "nome_capitulo": "Hour 1",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "026",
   "texto": "You call out. Nobody answers.",
   "capitulo": "1",
   "nome_capitulo": "Hour 1",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "027",
   "texto": "And here's the first rule of Level 0.",
   "capitulo": "1",
   "nome_capitulo": "Hour 1",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "028",
   "texto": "Even if someone had fallen in right beside you, you would never find each other.",
   "capitulo": "1",
   "nome_capitulo": "Hour 1",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "029",
   "texto": "You're alone. Completely.",
   "capitulo": "1",
   "nome_capitulo": "Hour 1",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "030",
   "texto": "So you walk.",
   "capitulo": "1",
   "nome_capitulo": "Hour 1",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "031",
   "texto": "Every room looks like the back of an office, or a store that was never finished.",
   "capitulo": "1",
   "nome_capitulo": "Hour 1",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "032",
   "texto": "Psychologists have a name for why that feels so wrong.",
   "capitulo": "1",
   "nome_capitulo": "Hour 1",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "033",
   "texto": "In 2022, a study found that places feel most uncanny when they're almost normal, with something in their structure slightly off.",
   "capitulo": "1",
   "nome_capitulo": "Hour 1",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": true
  },
  {
   "id": "034",
   "texto": "Level 0 is exactly that. Familiar, and wrong, in every direction.",
   "capitulo": "1",
   "nome_capitulo": "Hour 1",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "035",
   "texto": "By hour nine, you notice something worse.",
   "capitulo": "2",
   "nome_capitulo": "Hour 9",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": true,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "036",
   "texto": "You've seen this room before. That stain. That corner.",
   "capitulo": "2",
   "nome_capitulo": "Hour 9",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "037",
   "texto": "You're walking in circles.",
   "capitulo": "2",
   "nome_capitulo": "Hour 9",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "038",
   "texto": "That isn't just the Backrooms. That's you.",
   "capitulo": "2",
   "nome_capitulo": "Hour 9",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "039",
   "texto": "In 2009, German researchers sent people walking for hours through a forest and across the Sahara, tracked by GPS.",
   "capitulo": "2",
   "nome_capitulo": "Hour 9",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": true
  },
  {
   "id": "040",
   "texto": "When they could see the sun, they drifted, but kept going straight.",
   "capitulo": "2",
   "nome_capitulo": "Hour 9",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "041",
   "texto": "When clouds covered it, they walked in circles.",
   "capitulo": "2",
   "nome_capitulo": "Hour 9",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "042",
   "texto": "Blindfolded, some walked circles less than twenty meters wide.",
   "capitulo": "2",
   "nome_capitulo": "Hour 9",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": true,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "043",
   "texto": "In Level 0, there is no sun.",
   "capitulo": "2",
   "nome_capitulo": "Hour 9",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "044",
   "texto": "And there's something else. The wiki calls it the Peripheral Shift.",
   "capitulo": "2",
   "nome_capitulo": "Hour 9",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "045",
   "texto": "When you're not looking, the rooms rearrange themselves, sometimes erasing days of hallways you've already walked.",
   "capitulo": "2",
   "nome_capitulo": "Hour 9",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "046",
   "texto": "So the map in your head is useless.",
   "capitulo": "2",
   "nome_capitulo": "Hour 9",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "047",
   "texto": "Then there's the thirst.",
   "capitulo": "2",
   "nome_capitulo": "Hour 9",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "048",
   "texto": "The carpet is wet, but what soaks it is nothing you should drink.",
   "capitulo": "2",
   "nome_capitulo": "Hour 9",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "049",
   "texto": "Some of it is salt water. Some of it is formaldehyde.",
   "capitulo": "2",
   "nome_capitulo": "Hour 9",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "050",
   "texto": "Real research shows that losing just one or two percent of your body weight in water already hurts your mood and focus, and gives you headaches.",
   "capitulo": "2",
   "nome_capitulo": "Hour 9",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": true,
   "extra": true
  },
  {
   "id": "051",
   "texto": "And in Level 0, the wiki says, most lives end exactly this way: dehydration, or starvation.",
   "capitulo": "2",
   "nome_capitulo": "Hour 9",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "052",
   "texto": "Then, somewhere to your left, a wall flickers.",
   "capitulo": "2",
   "nome_capitulo": "Hour 9",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "053",
   "texto": "You don't know how long you've been here. Your phone died on day one. Or what you think was day one.",
   "capitulo": "3",
   "nome_capitulo": "Day 3?",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": true,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": true
  },
  {
   "id": "054",
   "texto": "In 1962, a French scientist named Michel Siffre lived alone in a cave for about two months, with no clock and no sunlight.",
   "capitulo": "3",
   "nome_capitulo": "Day 3?",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": true
  },
  {
   "id": "055",
   "texto": "When they told him it was over, he thought it was the twentieth of August.",
   "capitulo": "3",
   "nome_capitulo": "Day 3?",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": true,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "056",
   "texto": "It was the middle of September. He had lost almost a month.",
   "capitulo": "3",
   "nome_capitulo": "Day 3?",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": true,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "057",
   "texto": "Keep that in mind. Your count is already wrong.",
   "capitulo": "3",
   "nome_capitulo": "Day 3?",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "058",
   "texto": "The flickering wall is the way out. You throw yourself through it.",
   "capitulo": "3",
   "nome_capitulo": "Day 3?",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "059",
   "texto": "If you want the next story like this one, that's what the subscribe button is for. Now, Level 1.",
   "capitulo": "3",
   "nome_capitulo": "Day 3?",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": true
  },
  {
   "id": "060",
   "texto": "Level 1. The wiki calls it the Habitable Zone.",
   "capitulo": "4",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 1",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": true,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "061",
   "texto": "It's an endless underground parking garage crossed with an abandoned warehouse. Concrete, pillars, pipes.",
   "capitulo": "4",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 1",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "062",
   "texto": "And it has the two things Level 0 didn't: supplies, and people.",
   "capitulo": "4",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 1",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "063",
   "texto": "Wooden crates appear out of nowhere, often right behind your back.",
   "capitulo": "4",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 1",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "064",
   "texto": "Inside: food, clothes, tools. And metal bottles.",
   "capitulo": "4",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 1",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "065",
   "texto": "Almond Water.",
   "capitulo": "4",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 1",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "066",
   "texto": "According to the wiki, one full bottle is worth a healthy six-hundred-calorie meal. Three a day keep you alive.",
   "capitulo": "4",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 1",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": true,
   "extra": true
  },
  {
   "id": "067",
   "texto": "One rule: never drink from a bottle that isn't full. Someone else had it first.",
   "capitulo": "4",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 1",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "068",
   "texto": "You sleep in one of the small rooms off the corridors, with furniture pushed against the door.",
   "capitulo": "4",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 1",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "069",
   "texto": "But you never lock it. Locks here have a way of disappearing, and people have died trapped inside.",
   "capitulo": "4",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 1",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": true
  },
  {
   "id": "070",
   "texto": "On what you think is day five, the lights go out.",
   "capitulo": "4",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 1",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "071",
   "texto": "The wiki calls it Flickering, and says it might be one of the deadliest things in the Backrooms.",
   "capitulo": "4",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 1",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": true
  },
  {
   "id": "072",
   "texto": "In the dark, things come out.",
   "capitulo": "4",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 1",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "073",
   "texto": "The rule is simple: don't turn on your flashlight.",
   "capitulo": "4",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 1",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "074",
   "texto": "Being the only light in the area, the wiki says, leads to a quick death.",
   "capitulo": "4",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 1",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "075",
   "texto": "So you sit in the dark, and you listen.",
   "capitulo": "4",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 1",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "076",
   "texto": "Something walks past your door. Then it stops.",
   "capitulo": "4",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 1",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "077",
   "texto": "And a human voice says your name.",
   "capitulo": "4",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 1",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "078",
   "texto": "Hold on to that moment. This exact trick comes back at the end of your story.",
   "capitulo": "4",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 1",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "079",
   "texto": "You don't answer. The lights come back.",
   "capitulo": "4",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 1",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "080",
   "texto": "In the morning, you find out what it was.",
   "capitulo": "4",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 1",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "081",
   "texto": "The wiki calls them Skin-Stealers: tall, pale things that wear the skin of the people they catch.",
   "capitulo": "4",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 1",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "082",
   "texto": "They copy voices without understanding the words.",
   "capitulo": "4",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 1",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "083",
   "texto": "Survivors have a rhyme for them: \"Blood runs red, they're not dead. Blood runs clear, don't get near.\"",
   "capitulo": "4",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 1",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": true
  },
  {
   "id": "084",
   "texto": "The people who teach you that rhyme wear lime-yellow, with an eagle on the shoulder.",
   "capitulo": "4",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 1",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "085",
   "texto": "The M.E.G. The Major Explorer Group.",
   "capitulo": "4",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 1",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "086",
   "texto": "You've been found.",
   "capitulo": "4",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 1",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "087",
   "texto": "Base Alpha is the oldest M.E.G. base, built in the corridors of Level 1.",
   "capitulo": "5",
   "nome_capitulo": "Week 3",
   "trilha": "jazz",
   "inicio_capitulo": true,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "088",
   "texto": "Newcomers take a test, and then get a job: exploration, archives, research or maintenance.",
   "capitulo": "5",
   "nome_capitulo": "Week 3",
   "trilha": "jazz",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "089",
   "texto": "You end up in exploration. Of course you do.",
   "capitulo": "5",
   "nome_capitulo": "Week 3",
   "trilha": "jazz",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "090",
   "texto": "There's a diner. People trade Almond Water like money.",
   "capitulo": "5",
   "nome_capitulo": "Week 3",
   "trilha": "jazz",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "091",
   "texto": "For a few weeks, life is almost normal. Shifts, meals, sleep.",
   "capitulo": "5",
   "nome_capitulo": "Week 3",
   "trilha": "jazz",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "092",
   "texto": "Your partner on the team is a woman who's been down here for six years. She teaches you how to hold a rifle without shaking.",
   "capitulo": "5",
   "nome_capitulo": "Week 3",
   "trilha": "jazz",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": true
  },
  {
   "id": "093",
   "texto": "And she teaches you the rules the veterans never joke about.",
   "capitulo": "5",
   "nome_capitulo": "Week 3",
   "trilha": "jazz",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "094",
   "texto": "One: if you see party decorations, or a poster that says \"Time 4 Fun\", turn around.",
   "capitulo": "5",
   "nome_capitulo": "Week 3",
   "trilha": "jazz",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "095",
   "texto": "Two: never trust a voice. Trust blood.",
   "capitulo": "5",
   "nome_capitulo": "Week 3",
   "trilha": "jazz",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "096",
   "texto": "At the gate of Base Gamma, the big M.E.G. base on Level 3, a guard pricks the finger of everyone who walks in, to check that their blood is red.",
   "capitulo": "5",
   "nome_capitulo": "Week 3",
   "trilha": "jazz",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": true
  },
  {
   "id": "097",
   "texto": "The wiki says no exceptions are ever made. Not even for the people who run the M.E.G.",
   "capitulo": "5",
   "nome_capitulo": "Week 3",
   "trilha": "jazz",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "098",
   "texto": "Three: Level 3 is the one place nobody jokes about at all.",
   "capitulo": "5",
   "nome_capitulo": "Week 3",
   "trilha": "jazz",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "099",
   "texto": "Even the M.E.G. calls traveling there \"extremely ill-advised.\"",
   "capitulo": "5",
   "nome_capitulo": "Week 3",
   "trilha": "jazz",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "100",
   "texto": "Twenty percent of its entire budget goes to one thing: keeping Base Gamma alive.",
   "capitulo": "5",
   "nome_capitulo": "Week 3",
   "trilha": "jazz",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": true,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "101",
   "texto": "Months pass. Your count says day two hundred. You don't trust it anymore.",
   "capitulo": "6",
   "nome_capitulo": "Day 200?",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": true,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "102",
   "texto": "Then your team gets its first long expedition: carry medicine and data from Base Alpha to Base Gamma.",
   "capitulo": "6",
   "nome_capitulo": "Day 200?",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": true
  },
  {
   "id": "103",
   "texto": "Two levels. Level 2, then Level 3.",
   "capitulo": "6",
   "nome_capitulo": "Day 200?",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "104",
   "texto": "Eight of you. Rifles, flares, and a crate of supplies.",
   "capitulo": "6",
   "nome_capitulo": "Day 200?",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "105",
   "texto": "Level 2 first. Maintenance tunnels. Pipes everywhere. Machines humming with no purpose.",
   "capitulo": "6",
   "nome_capitulo": "Day 200?",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "106",
   "texto": "Every turn is exactly forty-five degrees.",
   "capitulo": "6",
   "nome_capitulo": "Day 200?",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "107",
   "texto": "The lights are wired together, so when one fails, a whole grid of them goes dark.",
   "capitulo": "6",
   "nome_capitulo": "Day 200?",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "108",
   "texto": "In the dark parts, there are Smilers. You never see a body. Just a long smile full of teeth, and two white eyes.",
   "capitulo": "6",
   "nome_capitulo": "Day 200?",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": true
  },
  {
   "id": "109",
   "texto": "So you do what you were taught. Light off. Eye contact. Walk away slowly.",
   "capitulo": "6",
   "nome_capitulo": "Day 200?",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "110",
   "texto": "At every corner, you go silent, because of the Clumps: piles of limbs that wait in tight corridors. Within eight feet, they reach.",
   "capitulo": "6",
   "nome_capitulo": "Day 200?",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": true,
   "extra": true
  },
  {
   "id": "111",
   "texto": "Nobody dies on Level 2. For a moment, you think the hard part is over.",
   "capitulo": "6",
   "nome_capitulo": "Day 200?",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "112",
   "texto": "Then you reach the door.",
   "capitulo": "6",
   "nome_capitulo": "Day 200?",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "113",
   "texto": "Most of the doors from Level 2 into Level 3 are barricaded, or covered in warning signs. This one has both. And a gap.",
   "capitulo": "6",
   "nome_capitulo": "Day 200?",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": true
  },
  {
   "id": "114",
   "texto": "Psychologists say walking through a doorway makes people forget what they were just holding in mind.",
   "capitulo": "6",
   "nome_capitulo": "Day 200?",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "115",
   "texto": "Remember that. On the other side, forgetting one small rule is all it takes.",
   "capitulo": "6",
   "nome_capitulo": "Day 200?",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "116",
   "texto": "Level 3. The Electrical Station.",
   "capitulo": "7",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 3",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": true,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "117",
   "texto": "Brick walls in mismatched colors. Dusty concrete. Weak fluorescent lights. Cables and fuse boxes everywhere.",
   "capitulo": "7",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 3",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "118",
   "texto": "Pipes full of a thick black liquid. Some corridors are barely wider than your shoulders.",
   "capitulo": "7",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 3",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "119",
   "texto": "And metal bars across most of the hallways. Bars nobody has ever managed to break.",
   "capitulo": "7",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 3",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "120",
   "texto": "The danger here isn't one monster. It's what the monsters do together.",
   "capitulo": "7",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 3",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "121",
   "texto": "The wiki says the entities on Level 3 attack in \"military-esque brigades\", with careful planning, and a better map of the level than yours.",
   "capitulo": "7",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 3",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": true
  },
  {
   "id": "122",
   "texto": "Seeing one entity wandering by itself almost never happens.",
   "capitulo": "7",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 3",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "123",
   "texto": "And sometimes, those brigades lead a wanderer, on purpose, into a dead end.",
   "capitulo": "7",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 3",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "124",
   "texto": "Two hours in, you meet a man in a hooded coat and a mask.",
   "capitulo": "7",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 3",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "125",
   "texto": "He says he's lost. He has a thick accent. He's limping. He asks for water.",
   "capitulo": "7",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 3",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "126",
   "texto": "You're tired. He's human. Nobody asks to see his blood.",
   "capitulo": "7",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 3",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "127",
   "texto": "A hundred yards later, there's a dim light at the end of the corridor. No lamp. No source.",
   "capitulo": "7",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 3",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": true
  },
  {
   "id": "128",
   "texto": "The wiki has a line about those lights: Smilers with their eyes and lips shut, standing guard for the brigades.",
   "capitulo": "7",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 3",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": true
  },
  {
   "id": "129",
   "texto": "Someone points a flashlight at it.",
   "capitulo": "7",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 3",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "130",
   "texto": "The smile opens.",
   "capitulo": "7",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 3",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "131",
   "texto": "Behind you, the man in the coat pulls at his own face, and the skin comes loose.",
   "capitulo": "7",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 3",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "132",
   "texto": "Something leaps from the dark at the back of the line. A Hound.",
   "capitulo": "7",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 3",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "133",
   "texto": "The wiki says the Hounds here have mastered surprise: they hide, and pounce from behind.",
   "capitulo": "7",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 3",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "134",
   "texto": "The last man in your line is gone before anyone can turn around.",
   "capitulo": "7",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 3",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "135",
   "texto": "So you run. Eight of you, then seven, down the only hallway that's open.",
   "capitulo": "7",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 3",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "136",
   "texto": "Behind you, the barking gets faster. More excited.",
   "capitulo": "7",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 3",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "137",
   "texto": "The wiki explains that too. On Level 3, the Hounds bark faster when their prey turns toward a dead end.",
   "capitulo": "7",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 3",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": true
  },
  {
   "id": "138",
   "texto": "You turn left. The barking turns into a howl.",
   "capitulo": "7",
   "nome_capitulo": "Level 3",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "139",
   "texto": "The corridor ends in metal bars.",
   "capitulo": "8",
   "nome_capitulo": "The bars",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": true,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "140",
   "texto": "And through the bars, maybe forty yards away, you can see the lights of Base Gamma.",
   "capitulo": "8",
   "nome_capitulo": "The bars",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": true,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "141",
   "texto": "Guards. Sandbags. A gate. A man with a needle, ready to prick your finger.",
   "capitulo": "8",
   "nome_capitulo": "The bars",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "142",
   "texto": "If anyone had pricked one finger two hours ago, you'd be standing over there.",
   "capitulo": "8",
   "nome_capitulo": "The bars",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "143",
   "texto": "Your team turns around and fights.",
   "capitulo": "8",
   "nome_capitulo": "The bars",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "144",
   "texto": "Clumps eight feet tall, holding weapons. Facelings with brick shields and blades.",
   "capitulo": "8",
   "nome_capitulo": "The bars",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "145",
   "texto": "And somewhere behind them, giving orders, a Death Rat. The wiki calls them the leaders of these operations.",
   "capitulo": "8",
   "nome_capitulo": "The bars",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": true
  },
  {
   "id": "146",
   "texto": "Rifles. Flares. Your partner throws Firesalt, and for a moment the corridor burns white.",
   "capitulo": "8",
   "nome_capitulo": "The bars",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "147",
   "texto": "Then the Deathmoths come in.",
   "capitulo": "8",
   "nome_capitulo": "The bars",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "148",
   "texto": "The wiki says a swarm goes for the mouth and the lungs, and can kill in a matter of seconds.",
   "capitulo": "8",
   "nome_capitulo": "The bars",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": true
  },
  {
   "id": "149",
   "texto": "Your partner goes down first. You hear her stop breathing.",
   "capitulo": "8",
   "nome_capitulo": "The bars",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "150",
   "texto": "Then the others. One by one.",
   "capitulo": "8",
   "nome_capitulo": "The bars",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "151",
   "texto": "You're the last one, back against the bars, out of ammunition.",
   "capitulo": "8",
   "nome_capitulo": "The bars",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "152",
   "texto": "The Hounds on Level 3 don't kill quickly.",
   "capitulo": "8",
   "nome_capitulo": "The bars",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "153",
   "texto": "The wiki says they try to make it as slow and as painful as possible.",
   "capitulo": "8",
   "nome_capitulo": "The bars",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "154",
   "texto": "One bites the back of your neck. Not enough to kill you. Just enough so you can't move.",
   "capitulo": "8",
   "nome_capitulo": "The bars",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": true
  },
  {
   "id": "155",
   "texto": "You open your mouth to scream for the guards at the gate.",
   "capitulo": "8",
   "nome_capitulo": "The bars",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "156",
   "texto": "The second Hound takes your voice before you can.",
   "capitulo": "8",
   "nome_capitulo": "The bars",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "157",
   "texto": "The lights of Base Gamma are still on. Forty yards.",
   "capitulo": "8",
   "nome_capitulo": "The bars",
   "trilha": "tensa",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "158",
   "texto": "The M.E.G. keeps a record of every wanderer.",
   "capitulo": "9",
   "nome_capitulo": "The log",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": true,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "159",
   "texto": "Yours is short. Expedition to Base Gamma. Eight members. None arrived.",
   "capitulo": "9",
   "nome_capitulo": "The log",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "160",
   "texto": "Your count said you'd been in the Backrooms for about two hundred days.",
   "capitulo": "9",
   "nome_capitulo": "The log",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "161",
   "texto": "By M.E.G. time, it was closer to four hundred.",
   "capitulo": "9",
   "nome_capitulo": "The log",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "162",
   "texto": "The guards at Base Gamma reported barking that night, very close to the bars.",
   "capitulo": "9",
   "nome_capitulo": "The log",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "163",
   "texto": "Nobody heard a scream.",
   "capitulo": "9",
   "nome_capitulo": "The log",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "164",
   "texto": "Base Gamma still checks every finger at the gate.",
   "capitulo": "9",
   "nome_capitulo": "The log",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "165",
   "texto": "And on Level 3, a few weeks later, a patrol meets a man in a hooded coat.",
   "capitulo": "9",
   "nome_capitulo": "The log",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "166",
   "texto": "He's lost. He's limping. He asks for water.",
   "capitulo": "9",
   "nome_capitulo": "The log",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  },
  {
   "id": "167",
   "texto": "He has your voice.",
   "capitulo": "9",
   "nome_capitulo": "The log",
   "trilha": "liminar",
   "inicio_capitulo": false,
   "cartao": false,
   "extra": false
  }
 ]
}